This repo containes source code for jos (joy operating system) which was developed during operating system kernel dvelopment course.

Every lab was done on its own branch

This branch contains an implementation of individual task which was to implement a JIT-compiler for web-assembly. 

Code is contained at user/wasm. It includes
- binary files parser for wasm1.0
- virtual machine with support for most (however, not all) instructions
- jit-compiler with support for some instructions
- web-assembly system interface implementation for jos
- examples, including hello-world and doom

